# Deny by default: excludes .git, .venv, caches, .env/secrets, audit reports,
# backups/logs, internal assets, RAW/CLEAN, notebooks, tests, and Experiments.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock

